  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Making its debut in our first-ever collection, the Sam bag has been a perennial crowd favorite and a key part of our heritage. Our Sam Icon mini tote brings back the original design from 1993 in spazzolato leather—a smooth cowhide leather with a light sheen and polished finish—for a sleek and compact look. Now reimagined nylon, it is durable and easy to clean, so you can cherish this bag for many years to come. You know what they say…once an icon, always an icon.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> 100% recycled nylon</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Silver hardware</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Lining: fabric</li>\n<li><strong>Handle Drop:</strong> Handle drop: 3&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> 22&quot; drop detachable and adjustable crossbody strap</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: zip pocket and slip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Magnetic tab closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 7.3&quot; (L) x 4.8&quot; (H) x 3.00&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
